00:29:45,580 --> 00:29:45,840
Okay.

487
00:29:45,840 --> 00:29:48,380
Because the structure is different, the molecules behave differently,

488
00:29:48,560 --> 00:29:50,840
even though they are made of the exact same stuff.

489
00:29:51,100 --> 00:29:51,320
Okay.

490
00:29:51,400 --> 00:29:54,240
